---
import OpenChannelModes from '../../components/OpenChannelModes.astro';
import { WORKSHOPS } from '../../../public/open-channel/workshops.mjs';
export function getStaticPaths() {
  return [{ params: { mode: 'pitch-room' }, props: { workshopId: 'pitch' } }, { params: { mode: 'story-booth' }, props: { workshopId: 'story' } }];
}
const { workshopId } = Astro.props;
const config = WORKSHOPS[workshopId];
const canonical = `https://pointcast.xyz/open-channel/${workshopId === 'pitch' ? 'pitch-room' : 'story-booth'}/`;
const title = `${config.title} — Open Channel — PointCast`;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={config.description} /><meta name="theme-color" content="#151c20" /><link rel="canonical" href={canonical} /><link rel="alternate" type="application/json" href="/open-channel.json" /><meta property="og:title" content={title} /><meta property="og:description" content={config.description} /><meta property="og:url" content={canonical} /><meta property="og:type" content="website" /><meta property="og:image" content="https://pointcast.xyz/open-channel/cover.png" /><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/open-channel/style.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/open-channel/workshop.css" /></head>
<body data-workshop={workshopId}>
<a class="skip" href="#workshop">Skip to the exercise</a>
<div class="page">
<header class="masthead"><a class="pointcast" href="/">POINTCAST</a><a class="mast-note" href="/open-channel/">OPEN CHANNEL / THREE WAYS IN</a><a href="/apps/">All apps ↗</a></header>
<main>
<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">{config.kicker}</p><h1>{config.title}<span class="title-dot">.</span></h1><p class="lede">{config.description}</p></div><div class="edition"><span class="edition-circle" aria-hidden="true">{workshopId === 'pitch' ? '↗' : '✳'}</span><p>YOUR WORDS<br />A LITTLE STRUCTURE</p></div></section>
<OpenChannelModes active={workshopId} />
<div class="mode-note"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>{workshopId === 'pitch' ? 'Guided practice' : 'Guided writing'}</strong><span>Authored prompts · Browser voices · Dessa not connected</span><a href="/open-channel/#about">About the experiment ↗</a></div>
<section class="workshop-grid" aria-label={config.title}>
<aside class="exercise-picker"><div class="section-label"><span>01 / CHOOSE YOUR EXERCISE</span><span>3</span></div><div id="exercise-list"></div><p class="aside-note">Take it one prompt at a time.<br />There is room to change your mind.</p></aside>
<section id="workshop" class="workbench" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Guided exercise">
<div class="workbench-top"><span id="exercise-title"></span><span id="step-counter"></span></div>
<div class="step-rail" id="step-rail" aria-label="Exercise steps"></div>
<p class="prompt-label" id="prompt-label"></p><h2 id="question" tabindex="-1"></h2><p id="hint"></p>
<div class="prompt-voice"><button id="hear-prompt" type="button">◖)) Hear prompt</button><button id="stop-voice" type="button" disabled>■ Stop voice</button></div>
<label class="answer-label" for="answer">YOUR WORDS</label><textarea id="answer" maxlength="3000" rows="6" aria-describedby="hint storage-status"></textarea>
<div class="answer-meta"><span id="word-count">0 words</span><span>Up to 3,000 characters per answer</span></div>
<details class="dictation"><summary>Speak your answer</summary><p>Your browser may send audio to its speech service. PointCast does not record audio. Dictation adds text to this answer; you can edit it before moving on.</p><button id="dictate" type="button">Start microphone</button><p id="voice-status" role="status">Microphone is off.</p></details>
<div class="step-actions"><button id="previous" type="button">← Back</button><button id="next" class="primary" type="button">Next prompt →</button></div>
<p class="workbench-feedback" id="feedback" role="status">You can skip a prompt and return to it later.</p>
<div class="rehearsal"><div><span class="prompt-label">{workshopId === 'pitch' ? 'REHEARSE YOUR PITCH' : 'TELL IT BACK TO YOURSELF'}</span><p>A quiet timer. Nothing is recorded.</p></div><output id="timer" aria-label="Time remaining" aria-live="off">01:00</output><button id="timer-toggle" type="button">Start timer</button><button id="timer-reset" type="button">Reset</button></div>
<p id="storage-status" class="workshop-privacy">Answers are stored in this browser tab. Download to keep a copy.</p>
<div class="clear-row"><button id="clear" type="button">Clear this exercise</button><button id="cancel-clear" type="button" hidden>Keep my answers</button></div>
</section>
<aside class="outline-panel" aria-label="Your working outline"><div class="section-label"><span>02 / YOUR WORKING {workshopId === 'pitch' ? 'PITCH' : 'OUTLINE'}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p class="outline-heading">{workshopId === 'pitch' ? 'Make the point.' : 'Find the thread.'}</p><p class="outline-copy">Assembled from your answers. Edit any step to change it.</p><p id="progress-label"></p><progress id="progress" value="0" max="5"></progress><div id="outline" tabindex="0" aria-label="Working outline"></div><button id="download" type="button" disabled>Download outline ↓</button><fieldset class="self-review"><legend>Your own review</legend><p>Use these reminders to judge your draft. They are not an automated score.</p><div id="checklist"></div></fieldset></aside>
</section>
<section class="workshop-about"><h2>{workshopId === 'pitch' ? 'Practice makes room for a better conversation.' : 'Your idea. A place to begin.'}</h2><p>{workshopId === 'pitch' ? 'Answer the prompts in your own words, listen to them if it helps, then use the timer to rehearse. Revise the parts that feel awkward. The app organizes your draft; it does not judge your delivery or simulate a live customer.' : 'Use the questions as a way into the material. A sentence is enough to start. The outline keeps your words and marks unanswered sections so you can return to them. It does not generate a story for you.'}</p><p>Part of the independent <a href="/open-channel/">Open Channel</a> experiment, inspired by <a href="https://block.xyz/dessa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dessa</a>. This edition uses written prompts and optional browser speech features. Dessa is not connected.</p></section>
</main><footer><a class="pointcast" href="/">POINTCAST</a><span>YOUR WORDS. OPEN FREQUENCIES.</span><a href="/open-channel.json">Project details ↗</a></footer>
</div><noscript><p class="noscript">This guided worksheet needs JavaScript. No model is connected.</p></noscript><script type="module" src="/open-channel/workshop-app.mjs" is:inline></script>
</body></html>
